WEBVTT

00:40.470 --> 00:41.920
The last ingredient

00:42.880 --> 00:44.480
is the Soul-Severing Ginseng.

00:44.480 --> 00:45.990
The veins of it

00:46.470 --> 00:48.530
perfectly match the lines on my palm.

00:49.150 --> 00:51.920
If your hand slips even slightly
when you cut it,

00:53.000 --> 00:55.470
the ginseng's poison will kill you first.

01:07.090 --> 01:08.200
Back then, when I was in Jianghuai,

01:08.200 --> 01:10.170
I set up a simple scam.

01:10.789 --> 01:12.070
But I never expected

01:12.840 --> 01:14.170
the knockout drug I used

01:15.400 --> 01:16.870
to be switched for poison.

01:19.120 --> 01:20.050
What do you mean?

01:23.750 --> 01:25.350
That's how your whole family

01:27.120 --> 01:29.250
was wrongfully accused and suffered.

01:35.280 --> 01:36.920
I remember I told you

01:38.560 --> 01:39.950
who set it up.

01:40.120 --> 01:41.070
What is it again?

01:42.610 --> 01:43.539
Zhang Dancheng.

01:44.680 --> 01:45.120
Right,

01:46.280 --> 01:47.210
Zhang Dancheng.

01:51.960 --> 01:53.200
I am Zhang Dancheng.

01:55.120 --> 01:56.680
Your last enemy.

02:02.210 --> 02:02.840
Mentor,

02:05.350 --> 02:06.460
are you kidding?

02:07.840 --> 02:09.570
I'm just telling you the truth.

02:11.680 --> 02:13.310
You can't be soft-hearted

02:14.120 --> 02:16.250
when dealing with the Tianxiang Sect.

02:16.710 --> 02:17.840
Being soft-hearted

02:19.590 --> 02:21.280
will get you killed.

02:39.030 --> 02:40.710
So you found me

02:42.630 --> 02:43.540
and taught me

02:44.360 --> 02:45.400
just to use me

02:45.400 --> 02:47.800
to kill the Sect Master
to avenge yourself?

02:49.480 --> 02:50.230
Exactly.

02:51.910 --> 02:52.680
Exactly.

02:54.310 --> 02:55.280
When we met

02:56.310 --> 02:57.470
8 years ago,

02:58.550 --> 03:00.320
this day was bound to come.

03:07.590 --> 03:08.680
When I'm gone,

03:09.120 --> 03:10.520
you must remember

03:11.030 --> 03:12.280
how to walk

03:13.340 --> 03:14.200
the road ahead.

03:58.680 --> 03:59.610
Zhang Dancheng.

04:02.870 --> 04:04.470
After I kill the Sect Master,

04:08.110 --> 04:10.080
I'll come back for your life.

04:11.130 --> 04:11.970
OK.

04:13.080 --> 04:13.750
OK.

04:16.600 --> 04:18.130
Your training is complete.

04:19.570 --> 04:20.839
It's time to set out.

04:22.560 --> 04:23.870
But remember,

04:25.360 --> 04:26.620
there's only one thing

04:27.240 --> 04:28.680
that never changes.

04:30.920 --> 04:32.320
The people closest to you

04:33.430 --> 04:34.040
are

04:36.360 --> 04:37.190
the most...

04:39.120 --> 04:40.360
the most dangerous.

04:41.470 --> 04:42.730
The knife is in my hand.

04:44.880 --> 04:46.320
I know how to use it.

04:51.630 --> 04:52.830
Mentor.

07:26.620 --> 07:30.150
[A Prophet]

07:31.190 --> 07:33.400
[Episode 6]

07:44.040 --> 07:45.480
How should I address you?

07:46.490 --> 07:47.850
You don't remember me?

07:50.150 --> 07:51.150
That makes sense.

07:51.610 --> 07:53.670
You've seen plenty of people like me.

07:54.330 --> 07:55.940
It's normal that you don't remember me.

07:55.940 --> 07:57.540
I definitely remember those

07:57.890 --> 07:59.490
who perform with me on stage.

07:59.860 --> 08:01.390
But there are so many people

08:01.770 --> 08:03.300
in the audience,

08:04.060 --> 08:05.740
so how could I possibly remember them all?

08:05.740 --> 08:06.450
My

08:07.860 --> 08:08.720
surname is Lyu.

08:09.740 --> 08:10.860
Lyu Ruhui.

08:13.130 --> 08:14.500
Lyu Ruhui?

08:15.250 --> 08:16.850
Miss Jiang remembers me now?

08:18.940 --> 08:21.060
Hui—when darkness reaches
its deepest, light is born.

08:21.060 --> 08:22.210
That's a good name.

08:23.210 --> 08:24.860
Judging by your outfit,

08:25.450 --> 08:26.330
what line

08:27.010 --> 08:28.250
of work are you in?

08:29.540 --> 08:30.470
Corpse Driving.

08:30.980 --> 08:33.039
If you've mastered corpse-driving,

08:33.330 --> 08:34.570
surely you can

08:35.610 --> 08:37.140
read fortunes too, Mr. Lyu.

08:37.299 --> 08:38.429
I know a thing or two.

08:39.059 --> 08:40.850
Then could I trouble you

08:41.380 --> 08:42.299
to read

08:44.570 --> 08:45.690
my palm?

09:05.780 --> 09:07.970
Miss Jiang,
you're blessed with good fortune.

09:07.970 --> 09:09.450
Your financial luck is good,

09:09.450 --> 09:10.810
and your romantic luck is strong, too.

09:10.810 --> 09:13.010
But you have too many crossroads ahead.

09:13.210 --> 09:15.340
I'm afraid you won't live much longer.

09:16.900 --> 09:17.900
Are you serious,

09:17.970 --> 09:18.730
Mr. Lyu?

09:20.810 --> 09:22.180
Absolutely.

09:24.380 --> 09:26.240
There are so many people outside.

09:26.310 --> 09:27.420
I advise you

09:28.250 --> 09:29.520
not to be impulsive.

09:29.900 --> 09:30.610
What?

09:31.450 --> 09:34.090
Do you think my fortune-telling
is inaccurate?

09:34.090 --> 09:35.220
No, you got it right.

09:36.330 --> 09:37.450
But in my opinion,

09:37.940 --> 09:38.850
Mr. Lyu,

09:39.180 --> 09:40.380
you missed one thing.

09:42.610 --> 09:43.730
What did I miss?

09:45.810 --> 09:47.270
I bring luck to my husband.

09:47.810 --> 09:49.540
Bringing luck to your husband?

09:49.690 --> 09:51.420
You must be joking, Miss Jiang.

09:51.780 --> 09:54.310
Are you sure you're not a jinx
to your husband?

09:54.420 --> 09:55.810
If I were a jinx,

09:56.380 --> 09:57.260
sir,

09:57.900 --> 10:00.430
how are you still sitting here
safe and sound?

10:02.540 --> 10:04.740
You even have the army at your disposal.

10:05.300 --> 10:06.260
Miss Jiang,

10:07.210 --> 10:08.300
it's been 8 years,

10:09.260 --> 10:11.520
and you've certainly risen in the world.

10:13.380 --> 10:15.710
Whether I've risen or not
doesn't matter.

10:16.010 --> 10:17.740
What matters is, you've fallen

10:18.060 --> 10:18.660
so low that

10:18.660 --> 10:20.790
even a dog can take a bite out of you now.

10:23.330 --> 10:24.610
Then please tell me,

10:25.570 --> 10:26.330
is this dog

10:27.180 --> 10:28.450
blind

10:28.900 --> 10:29.900
or not?

10:35.380 --> 10:36.980
I think you're the blind one.

10:38.970 --> 10:41.540
You don't even know
whose corpses you're transporting.

10:41.540 --> 10:43.270
Corpse Driving is just a cover.

10:44.420 --> 10:46.020
It's actually opium inside.

10:46.130 --> 10:47.730
Commander Feng

10:47.960 --> 10:50.160
has always hated opium like the plague.

10:51.060 --> 10:52.690
If he finds out

10:53.490 --> 10:56.780
you're using his fallen soldiers' bodies
to smuggle opium,

10:56.780 --> 10:58.240
what do you think he'll do?

11:00.180 --> 11:01.260
Now you finally know

11:01.260 --> 11:02.330
why Blind Du

11:02.900 --> 11:04.760
let you drive the corpses, right?

11:05.810 --> 11:07.870
If you don't want to be his scapegoat,

11:07.970 --> 11:08.970
just play along

11:10.140 --> 11:11.380
with me in this act.

11:15.210 --> 11:17.730
You'd better
think this through, Miss Jiang.

11:17.730 --> 11:18.930
When this act is over,

11:19.090 --> 11:20.150
if I'm still alive,

11:22.570 --> 11:23.610
you will be dead.

11:28.820 --> 11:30.750
Let's see if you can survive first.

11:32.880 --> 11:34.140
Why are you helping me?

11:48.730 --> 11:49.850
You're

11:49.850 --> 11:52.250
accusing my regiment colonel
and adjutant

11:52.330 --> 11:55.530
of using my fallen soldiers' corpses
to transport opium.

11:56.400 --> 11:59.000
If it were anyone else,
they'd already be dead.

11:59.260 --> 12:01.140
But why are you still alive?

12:01.850 --> 12:03.910
Please see clearly, Commander Feng.

12:11.610 --> 12:14.140
What's your relationship
with Jiang Feiyan?

12:18.090 --> 12:19.810
She's just an old friend of mine.

12:19.810 --> 12:21.210
You don't want to tell me?

12:29.940 --> 12:31.070
What happened today

12:31.310 --> 12:33.420
is bound to put them on their guard.

12:35.310 --> 12:37.500
If I can't catch them red-handed,

12:38.210 --> 12:40.540
I won't be able to answer
to the Commander.

12:40.540 --> 12:42.270
Rest assured, Commander Feng.

12:43.450 --> 12:45.450
I can make sure you catch them all,

12:46.090 --> 12:47.350
leaving no loose ends.

12:50.380 --> 12:51.310
Tell me about it.

12:52.420 --> 12:53.090
Kill me.

13:04.490 --> 13:05.970
Being able to wipe out these scumbags

13:05.970 --> 13:07.450
so thoroughly this time,

13:07.780 --> 13:09.190
I really have to thank you

13:10.020 --> 13:11.620
and that old friend of yours.

13:11.850 --> 13:12.730
Old friend?

13:14.780 --> 13:15.940
He told you that?

13:16.450 --> 13:18.450
He's not really an old friend, is he?

13:19.660 --> 13:20.300
Yes.

13:21.330 --> 13:22.390
He's an old friend.

13:27.540 --> 13:29.870
Why aren't you drinking, Commander Feng?

13:30.020 --> 13:31.730
Something's on your mind again?

13:31.730 --> 13:32.810
What's on my mind?

13:35.180 --> 13:36.330
There are too many scumbags

13:36.330 --> 13:39.140
like Lei San in this world.
That weighs on me.

13:39.490 --> 13:42.060
And the higher-ups deliberately
won't let me wipe out

13:42.060 --> 13:44.020
those damn swindlers in Longxuya.

13:44.020 --> 13:45.450
That weighs on me, too.

13:46.120 --> 13:48.430
Commander Feng,
you care deeply about your country,

13:48.430 --> 13:50.090
and you have lofty ambitions.

13:50.340 --> 13:51.530
It's just

13:52.090 --> 13:53.750
that the time is not right yet.

13:54.260 --> 13:55.830
If you trust me,

13:56.720 --> 13:58.600
I hope I can help you

13:59.060 --> 14:00.580
realize your ambitions.

14:46.790 --> 14:48.590
Aren't you afraid I poisoned it?

14:49.390 --> 14:51.080
Death is death. No matter

14:51.260 --> 14:52.730
who kills me or how.

14:53.660 --> 14:55.590
At least I'll die on a full stomach.

14:55.730 --> 14:56.790
It's not a bad deal.

14:58.330 --> 15:00.130
You really take death in stride.

15:01.300 --> 15:02.090
Kid,

15:02.260 --> 15:04.060
since you brought me this meal,

15:04.610 --> 15:06.670
I'll read your fortune one more time.

15:08.690 --> 15:10.940
By the Nanxi River,

15:12.380 --> 15:15.450
against the current, the corpses go.

15:23.210 --> 15:23.900
Kid,

15:24.180 --> 15:27.180
from the first day you came
looking for me at Longxuya,

15:28.530 --> 15:30.340
I knew who you were.

15:31.660 --> 15:32.570
You haven't

15:32.570 --> 15:34.940
changed much in 8 years.

15:35.730 --> 15:37.160
If you recognized me,

15:39.690 --> 15:40.940
why didn't you kill me?

15:40.940 --> 15:42.600
Killing you would be too easy.

15:43.300 --> 15:44.380
I kept you alive

15:44.480 --> 15:46.630
to draw out the person behind you.

15:57.090 --> 15:58.900
Three Yin converge to summon misfortune.

15:58.900 --> 16:00.570
Time to close the net.

16:00.970 --> 16:01.900
Zhang Dancheng,

16:01.900 --> 16:03.170
I know you're there.

16:04.490 --> 16:06.220
We were once fellow disciples.

16:06.560 --> 16:08.320
Let me tell you something.

16:08.970 --> 16:10.890
About what happened
with the Wang family back then,

16:10.890 --> 16:12.800
you thought I had set you up.

16:13.030 --> 16:14.220
It was the Sect Master

16:14.220 --> 16:17.560
who had the Qian family replace
the knockout drops with poison.

16:17.560 --> 16:19.890
He wanted you to be the one to kill.

16:20.380 --> 16:21.810
Didn't you live by the rules

16:21.810 --> 16:23.630
and refuse to break them
even if it meant death?

16:23.630 --> 16:26.200
So he used your own rules to destroy you.

16:26.780 --> 16:27.780
To put it bluntly,

16:28.080 --> 16:29.150
neither of us

16:29.170 --> 16:31.410
can escape the Sect Master's grasp.

16:31.850 --> 16:33.580
We're both pawns he discarded.

16:40.970 --> 16:42.260
This wine

16:42.330 --> 16:45.570
tastes like the drug the Qian family
used back then.

16:46.550 --> 16:48.000
It's quite bitter.

16:58.670 --> 16:59.380
Fine.

17:00.260 --> 17:01.020
Kid,

17:01.330 --> 17:02.450
for this wine,

17:02.740 --> 17:05.339
I'll read your Mentor's fortune
one more time.

17:29.970 --> 17:31.490
Kan means danger.

17:32.140 --> 17:33.870
The Lake over Water—hardship.

17:34.580 --> 17:36.180
The fourth line is changing.

17:37.620 --> 17:39.490
Your fate is trapped by stone,

17:40.490 --> 17:42.690
and your soul clings to moss.

17:44.530 --> 17:45.660
Zhang Dancheng,

17:45.820 --> 17:47.770
your fate is worse than mine.

17:48.290 --> 17:50.290
You'll die a worse death than I will!

17:56.810 --> 17:58.810
You've read fortunes all your life.

17:59.830 --> 18:01.790
Did you foresee dying here today?

18:02.290 --> 18:05.250
I read life, not death.

18:06.380 --> 18:08.820
I read other people's fates, not my own.

18:20.860 --> 18:23.120
I've pretended to be blind my whole life.

18:25.420 --> 18:27.530
Now I really can't see.

20:23.420 --> 20:26.340
I came from the mortal realm
to practice physiognomy.

20:26.340 --> 20:29.100
Everything in the mortal world
is already in the past.

20:29.100 --> 20:31.730
Thunder may strike, and fire may burn,
but the wind cannot be driven away.

20:31.730 --> 20:34.930
In life and death,
it's all within the art of physiognomy.

20:39.210 --> 20:40.290
Nobody moves!

20:40.970 --> 20:41.970
Nobody moves!

21:27.290 --> 21:29.770
[Longxuya]

21:28.450 --> 21:30.050
I joined the army at sixteen.

21:30.380 --> 21:33.210
I've fought my way through piles
of corpses to get where I am today.

21:33.210 --> 21:34.540
I don't believe in fate.

21:37.450 --> 21:38.780
I only believe in my gun.

21:50.380 --> 21:51.040
Commander,

21:51.210 --> 21:52.100
the remnants of Longxuya

21:52.100 --> 21:53.100
have all been arrested.

21:53.100 --> 21:53.960
Those who dared to resist

21:53.960 --> 21:55.160
were shot on the spot.

22:16.620 --> 22:17.420
You stay here.

22:17.580 --> 22:18.110
Yes, sir.

22:32.250 --> 22:33.940
Blind Du died last night.

22:34.530 --> 22:36.140
I heard

22:39.620 --> 22:40.950
you two met before that.

22:42.970 --> 22:43.730
If the higher-ups come asking,

22:43.730 --> 22:44.900
I'll need an answer.

22:46.720 --> 22:48.980
I might have to borrow your life for that.

22:52.640 --> 22:53.960
Commander Feng

22:54.490 --> 22:56.020
never leaves a root behind.

22:56.360 --> 22:57.490
But you should know,

22:58.010 --> 22:58.940
I'm not the root

22:59.050 --> 22:59.860
of this.

23:00.820 --> 23:02.080
Killing me won't help.

23:02.620 --> 23:03.900
Then where is the root?

23:26.250 --> 23:27.100
Spare me, sir!

23:27.140 --> 23:27.730
We're all

23:27.900 --> 23:29.100
in the same business.

23:29.320 --> 23:30.230
What happened?

23:38.100 --> 23:38.770
Liang,

23:40.180 --> 23:41.180
I toast to you.

23:41.210 --> 23:41.690
Come on.

23:47.620 --> 23:48.450
Fill it up.

23:49.770 --> 23:50.420
Come on.

23:53.970 --> 23:54.900
Liang,

23:56.010 --> 23:58.010
thanks for taking care of me lately.

23:58.660 --> 23:59.970
Take this money.

24:01.620 --> 24:02.750
We're parting ways.

24:03.970 --> 24:04.580
What?

24:05.380 --> 24:06.510
You said something?

24:07.530 --> 24:08.860
We're not parting ways.

24:12.210 --> 24:14.610
The road I'm taking next
is very dangerous.

24:16.100 --> 24:18.050
It'll only make things harder
if I take you with me.

24:18.050 --> 24:19.210
If it's dangerous,

24:19.530 --> 24:20.770
then you need me with you even more.

24:20.770 --> 24:23.100
Don't you know what I'm capable of?

24:57.580 --> 24:58.660
They call me

24:59.490 --> 25:00.140
Tongbei

25:00.730 --> 25:01.730
Little Spinning Top.

25:01.730 --> 25:02.420
Alright.

25:02.420 --> 25:03.660
Liang,

25:03.730 --> 25:05.140
I know you're capable.

25:05.250 --> 25:05.900
Sit down.

25:05.900 --> 25:06.580
Now you know, right?

25:06.580 --> 25:06.940
Sit.

25:13.210 --> 25:15.870
You saw what happened
to the people in Longxuya.

25:16.530 --> 25:17.210
Liang,

25:19.690 --> 25:21.690
being a swindler can get you killed.

25:25.100 --> 25:26.360
I don't want you to die.

25:28.580 --> 25:29.530
But my parents

25:30.010 --> 25:31.380
weren't swindlers.

25:32.090 --> 25:33.290
Why did they both die?

25:39.210 --> 25:41.010
Anyway, in this world,

25:41.580 --> 25:42.640
just staying alive

25:42.660 --> 25:43.580
isn't easy.

25:44.490 --> 25:45.580
If it's not easy,

25:47.140 --> 25:48.800
shouldn't we try to live well?

25:52.940 --> 25:53.900
Listen to me,

25:54.660 --> 25:56.120
leave the Tianxiang Sect.

25:56.770 --> 25:57.770
Their people

25:58.940 --> 26:00.100
never end up well.

26:02.490 --> 26:04.690
Aren't we both from the Tianxiang Sect?

26:05.450 --> 26:07.450
Then look at what they've done to us.

26:07.580 --> 26:08.510
What did they do?

26:09.250 --> 26:10.940
They made us scapegoats.

26:12.420 --> 26:13.420
That's exactly

26:13.490 --> 26:14.940
why I have to follow you!

26:15.690 --> 26:16.620
You're capable,

26:16.620 --> 26:18.450
and you won't use me as a scapegoat.

26:18.450 --> 26:19.450
I'm telling you, bro,

26:19.450 --> 26:20.450
whatever you do from now on,

26:20.450 --> 26:21.580
I'm coming with you.

26:24.660 --> 26:26.860
What if I wanted to kill the Sect Master?

26:32.250 --> 26:33.240
Don't talk nonsense.

26:33.240 --> 26:33.860
Ruhui.

26:33.890 --> 26:35.490
You don't have what it takes.

26:39.450 --> 26:40.180
Liang,

26:42.820 --> 26:44.420
my real name isn't Lyu Ruhui.

26:48.770 --> 26:50.570
My name is Shangguan Chengming.

27:02.550 --> 27:05.030
I'm not the root of this.

27:05.830 --> 27:07.110
Killing me won't help.

27:07.580 --> 27:09.010
Then where is the root?

27:09.970 --> 27:10.940
The true root

27:11.610 --> 27:13.040
is the buyer behind it all—

27:12.720 --> 27:14.700
[Mingcao Hall]

27:13.490 --> 27:14.430
the Qian family

27:14.940 --> 27:15.870
of Mingcao Hall.

27:31.250 --> 27:31.690
Sir,

27:31.970 --> 27:33.420
what herbs are you looking for?

27:33.420 --> 27:34.480
I'm just browsing.

27:37.580 --> 27:40.110
I hear this mountain
has plenty of fine herbs.

27:43.940 --> 27:44.450
Sir,

27:44.770 --> 27:46.210
you must be from out of town.

27:46.210 --> 27:47.940
Most of the purple dendrobium

27:48.050 --> 27:49.980
you see on the market comes from us.

27:50.730 --> 27:51.790
Purple dendrobium

27:51.970 --> 27:53.970
is worth its weight in gold these days.

27:53.970 --> 27:55.100
You have it in stock?

27:55.250 --> 27:56.050
Just a moment.

28:08.010 --> 28:09.070
Please take a look.

28:16.530 --> 28:17.860
It's indeed excellent.

28:18.820 --> 28:20.420
How much are you looking for?

28:21.820 --> 28:22.950
How much do you have?

28:24.180 --> 28:24.940
We have

28:25.140 --> 28:26.250
about 100 jins in stock.

28:26.250 --> 28:27.310
Can you take it all?

28:35.380 --> 28:36.580
I came from Nanyang.

28:36.770 --> 28:37.580
I'm planning

28:37.690 --> 28:39.380
to buy a batch of good medicinal herbs
to take back.

28:39.380 --> 28:41.040
If your herbs are good enough,

28:41.050 --> 28:43.050
we can establish a long-term partnership

28:43.050 --> 28:45.110
and do business together regularly.

28:45.820 --> 28:47.350
Let's talk somewhere else.

28:49.380 --> 28:49.970
Bro,

28:50.420 --> 28:53.580
a thousand cups of wine
are never enough with a true friend.

28:53.580 --> 28:55.380
I really feel a connection with you.

28:55.380 --> 28:56.140
I wonder

28:56.690 --> 28:58.210
if these three gold bars

28:58.450 --> 29:00.250
can make up for some of the goodwill

29:00.250 --> 29:01.980
you have earned with your wife.

29:02.210 --> 29:02.820
Bro,

29:04.010 --> 29:05.410
let me tell you the truth.

29:05.620 --> 29:06.660
Three gold bars

29:06.820 --> 29:07.860
are indeed

29:08.140 --> 29:09.530
a lot of money to me.

29:10.690 --> 29:11.450
But

29:11.900 --> 29:13.530
to my wife's family,

29:14.100 --> 29:15.180
it's just a drop

29:15.580 --> 29:16.530
in the bucket.

29:19.140 --> 29:21.870
I traveled all the way from Nanyang
to your place,

29:22.490 --> 29:23.660
not for

29:23.730 --> 29:25.390
a small deal of a few gold bars.

29:26.970 --> 29:27.900
What I want

29:30.010 --> 29:31.580
is the bucket.

29:34.940 --> 29:36.730
And what exactly is this "bucket"

29:36.730 --> 29:39.250
you're talking about, Chengming?

29:47.380 --> 29:49.290
The Qian family's Bashen Powder.

29:56.820 --> 29:57.450
My friend,

29:57.450 --> 29:58.510
don't joke around.

29:58.620 --> 29:59.480
The Qian family

29:59.530 --> 30:01.190
has been practicing medicine

30:01.580 --> 30:03.100
and dealing in herbs for generations.

30:03.100 --> 30:04.530
We've never had anything to do

30:04.530 --> 30:05.900
with the stuff you mentioned.

30:05.900 --> 30:07.010
I heard

30:07.660 --> 30:10.620
the Qian family's supply routes
have run into some trouble.

30:10.620 --> 30:12.480
You can't get the raw materials in

30:12.690 --> 30:14.220
and can't get the goods out.

30:18.490 --> 30:19.580
I can

30:20.420 --> 30:23.280
not only keep supplying
the Qian family with opium,

30:23.380 --> 30:25.580
but also sell Bashen Powder in Nanyang.

30:25.690 --> 30:27.100
With goods coming in and going out,

30:27.100 --> 30:29.960
you'll solve the Qian family's
immediate problem.

30:30.620 --> 30:32.340
And you'll definitely
be able to stand tall

30:32.340 --> 30:33.540
in front of your wife.

30:33.900 --> 30:35.380
You came prepared.

30:35.490 --> 30:37.010
Of course.

30:37.340 --> 30:39.200
Wenxin, you always keep your word

30:39.380 --> 30:41.110
and never shortchange anyone.

30:41.730 --> 30:44.450
Liuwei Dihuang pills have honey in them.

30:44.450 --> 30:47.180
When they come into contact with water,
their surface becomes sticky.

30:47.180 --> 30:49.580
But the surface of your pills
is dry and hard.

30:49.580 --> 30:52.100
These are pills made
with white sugar, right?

30:52.100 --> 30:53.820
The prescriptions passed down
from our ancestors

30:53.820 --> 30:55.100
must be followed exactly.

30:55.100 --> 30:56.380
The Qian family's reputation
over the years

30:56.380 --> 30:58.730
has been built up
bit by bit by you, Wenxin.

31:00.530 --> 31:02.390
I came all this way to do business.

31:02.620 --> 31:04.180
If I didn't come to you,

31:04.490 --> 31:06.290
wouldn't I be going out of my way?

31:06.730 --> 31:08.530
It's nothing worth mentioning.

31:14.210 --> 31:15.580
Looking at your face,

31:16.100 --> 31:17.290
you have a broad forehead

31:17.290 --> 31:18.890
and a prominent nose bridge.

31:18.970 --> 31:21.030
It's clearly a face of great fortune.

31:21.180 --> 31:22.580
If I'm not mistaken,

31:22.940 --> 31:23.900
Wenxin,

31:24.250 --> 31:26.690
you are the real source
of the Qian family's wealth.

31:26.690 --> 31:29.010
My friend,
you really know how to read people.

31:29.010 --> 31:31.050
My wife believes in this deeply.

31:31.050 --> 31:33.380
She has hired many masters
to read my face.

31:33.660 --> 31:34.530
They all said

31:34.900 --> 31:36.300
that I would bring wealth

31:37.140 --> 31:38.140
to the Qian family.

31:38.140 --> 31:41.010
And now I'm here,
bringing you more wealth.

31:41.580 --> 31:43.250
If we join forces,

31:43.380 --> 31:45.980
once Bashen Powder
starts selling in Nanyang,

31:46.100 --> 31:47.050
you won't

31:48.180 --> 31:50.510
have to answer to the Qian family anymore.

31:54.970 --> 31:56.140
Bashen Powder

31:56.970 --> 31:58.180
isn't mine to decide.

32:04.660 --> 32:06.590
Whether it's honey or white sugar,

32:06.770 --> 32:08.290
it's only a minor ingredient.

32:08.290 --> 32:09.690
It won't affect the efficacy.

32:09.690 --> 32:10.900
You changed the prescription
without authorization.

32:10.900 --> 32:12.580
How do you know it won't
affect the medicine?

32:12.580 --> 32:14.440
The Second Master approved this.

32:20.140 --> 32:21.010
It seems

32:23.300 --> 32:25.120
the son-in-law is still an outsider.

32:25.120 --> 32:26.280
Bashen Powder

32:27.290 --> 32:29.140
isn't mine to decide alone.

32:41.940 --> 32:43.470
We have guests in our house.

32:47.010 --> 32:47.730
Liang.

32:47.940 --> 32:50.200
No one could pull off this outfit but you.

32:51.210 --> 32:52.250
From now on,

32:52.530 --> 32:54.450
you are Master Chang Youliang,

32:54.450 --> 32:55.770
the 13th-generation successor

32:55.770 --> 32:57.250
of Zijin Temple on Mount Heyun.

32:57.250 --> 32:59.690
Boundless Heavenly Honor.

32:59.730 --> 33:02.050
You really nailed the tone and vibe.

33:02.180 --> 33:04.210
With my acting skills,

33:04.340 --> 33:06.470
I could make a living on stage for real.

33:08.420 --> 33:10.340
Where are we working today?

33:10.940 --> 33:11.870
The Qian family.

33:12.010 --> 33:12.940
The Qian family?

33:13.140 --> 33:13.770
What's their business?

33:13.770 --> 33:14.630
Do you remember

33:14.690 --> 33:16.350
whose opium we were smuggling

33:16.420 --> 33:18.020
when we drove those corpses?

33:18.380 --> 33:20.240
Then they are no ordinary family.

33:20.660 --> 33:22.140
Then they're no ordinary marks.

33:22.140 --> 33:22.620
So,

33:22.770 --> 33:24.430
you must promise me one thing.

33:25.100 --> 33:26.530
If I sense danger,

33:27.010 --> 33:28.690
I'll yell "dumb mark" at you.

33:29.530 --> 33:30.590
When that happens,

33:30.900 --> 33:31.730
just run

33:32.290 --> 33:33.250
and leave me behind.

33:33.250 --> 33:33.820
Wait,

33:34.620 --> 33:36.290
we're usually the ones who con the marks.

33:36.290 --> 33:37.530
Aren't you just insulting me?

33:37.530 --> 33:38.590
Pick another word.

33:39.820 --> 33:40.970
Sometimes,

33:40.970 --> 33:42.210
it's hard to tell

33:42.490 --> 33:43.420
who's the prey.

33:44.660 --> 33:45.460
Master Chang,

33:45.970 --> 33:47.940
this is my husband, Zhou Wenxin.

33:48.860 --> 33:50.420
T-This is my wife.

33:51.820 --> 33:52.820
What are you waiting for?

33:52.820 --> 33:54.750
You want me to serve you a cup of tea?

33:54.940 --> 33:56.100
We're not drinking.

33:56.230 --> 33:57.230
This way, please.

34:04.290 --> 34:05.210
Here.

34:07.420 --> 34:08.300
Master Chang,

34:08.610 --> 34:09.770
this is my Four Pillars of Destiny.

34:09.770 --> 34:11.170
Please take a look.

34:11.900 --> 34:13.699
Has something happened at home?

34:16.860 --> 34:18.420
I took a quick look.

34:19.380 --> 34:21.610
Something is off
about the courtyard's layout.

34:21.610 --> 34:22.739
If I'm not mistaken,

34:23.010 --> 34:24.940
the wealth position has been compromised.

34:24.940 --> 34:26.489
For merchants,

34:26.650 --> 34:29.090
a compromised wealth position
can have varying consequences.

34:29.090 --> 34:30.900
It could mean losing wealth,

34:31.170 --> 34:32.090
or

34:32.739 --> 34:34.170
even the destruction of your family.

34:34.170 --> 34:35.830
The destruction of my family?

34:35.860 --> 34:36.900
Master,

34:37.090 --> 34:38.620
is there a solution to this?

34:38.860 --> 34:41.050
Since ancient times,
power and wealth have been inseparable.

34:41.050 --> 34:42.420
A damaged wealth position

34:42.420 --> 34:45.219
can only be resolved by someone

34:45.530 --> 34:46.900
with military power.

34:48.010 --> 34:49.530
Military power....

34:49.820 --> 34:51.610
You mean someone in the military?

34:51.610 --> 34:53.380
Where am I supposed to find

34:53.610 --> 34:54.780
such a person?

34:54.900 --> 34:56.650
Looking at your Four Pillars of Destiny,

34:56.650 --> 34:59.860
you should have close ties to someone

35:00.010 --> 35:01.340
of considerable rank and influence.

35:01.340 --> 35:02.130
Pay

35:02.260 --> 35:04.860
more attention to the people
around you recently.

35:04.860 --> 35:05.780
There should be

35:05.860 --> 35:07.940
a benefactor who can help you.

35:09.010 --> 35:09.780
Master,

35:10.130 --> 35:10.900
could you give me

35:10.900 --> 35:12.010
a few more hints?

35:17.050 --> 35:19.420
When hardship ends,
fortune will return in time.

35:19.420 --> 35:21.950
A noble benefactor
will soon cross your path.

35:21.970 --> 35:24.500
When Dragon and Tiger
clash in the mountains,

35:24.820 --> 35:27.780
the reckless will eventually
encounter the worthy.

35:28.050 --> 35:29.610
The first half

35:30.170 --> 35:31.420
means

35:31.570 --> 35:32.740
a benefactor

35:32.860 --> 35:34.340
will appear soon.

35:35.380 --> 35:36.700
But the second half—

35:36.780 --> 35:38.700
"When Dragon and Tiger
clash in the mountains,

35:38.700 --> 35:42.260
the reckless will eventually
encounter the worthy" means...

35:42.740 --> 35:44.140
The time isn't right yet.

35:44.380 --> 35:45.380
Give it a few days,

35:45.740 --> 35:47.050
and you'll see.

36:00.050 --> 36:00.610
Honey,

36:01.170 --> 36:02.340
I had some wine.

36:02.530 --> 36:03.380
I won't keep you from resting.

36:03.380 --> 36:04.910
I'll sleep in the side room.

36:06.900 --> 36:09.700
Since when did you start
drinking Western liquor?

36:11.090 --> 36:12.650
A merchant from Nanyang

36:13.050 --> 36:14.580
named Shangguan Chengming

36:14.820 --> 36:16.090
wants to do business with us.

36:16.090 --> 36:17.340
So I just had a couple of drinks with him.

36:17.340 --> 36:18.420
From Nanyang?

36:19.340 --> 36:22.070
What business could he
possibly discuss with us?

36:25.010 --> 36:25.870
Bashen Powder.

36:28.130 --> 36:29.060
What did you say?

36:30.340 --> 36:32.400
You told him about the Bashen Powder?

36:33.170 --> 36:34.130
He brought it up.

36:34.220 --> 36:36.130
How would he know if you didn't tell him?

36:36.130 --> 36:36.650
I

36:37.260 --> 36:37.970
had some wine,

36:37.970 --> 36:39.340
and one thing led to another, so I...

36:39.340 --> 36:40.670
I ended up admitting it.

36:40.740 --> 36:42.820
You just ignore what I said,

36:42.820 --> 36:43.610
don't you?

36:43.820 --> 36:44.880
Blind Du's hideout

36:44.900 --> 36:46.740
was just raided by Commander Feng.

36:46.740 --> 36:47.900
If they keep investigating,

36:47.900 --> 36:49.780
they'll be coming after us
in a matter of days.

36:49.780 --> 36:51.380
We should be keeping
our heads down right now.

36:51.380 --> 36:52.380
And you just had to

36:52.450 --> 36:54.250
walk right into the line of fire!

36:56.220 --> 36:57.300
Honey,

36:58.170 --> 36:59.570
I think Chengming

36:59.820 --> 37:01.050
is someone we can trust.

37:01.050 --> 37:02.380
The roads are blocked right now,

37:02.380 --> 37:03.570
and we can't get the goods out.

37:03.570 --> 37:04.780
If we can really sell them

37:04.780 --> 37:05.820
to Nanyang as he said,

37:05.820 --> 37:07.150
it would be great for us.

37:07.530 --> 37:08.650
Nanyang?

37:08.820 --> 37:10.970
We can't even get the goods out
of the province right now.

37:10.970 --> 37:12.170
And have you thought about this?

37:12.170 --> 37:13.380
If the Tianxiang Sect

37:13.490 --> 37:15.260
finds out about the Bashen Powder,

37:15.260 --> 37:17.170
do you think our family
will make it out alive?

37:17.170 --> 37:19.490
Isn't Blind Du from the Tianxiang Sect?

37:19.610 --> 37:20.530
Zhou Wenxin, oh,

37:20.530 --> 37:21.340
Zhou Wenxin.

37:21.610 --> 37:22.780
Will you ever learn?

37:23.010 --> 37:24.820
I've entrusted the family business
to you for so many years.

37:24.820 --> 37:26.300
Don't you know the rules
of the underworld?

37:26.300 --> 37:28.900
The Sect Master doesn't allow
his men to touch drugs.

37:28.900 --> 37:31.220
The Sect Master won't
even make money when he could?

37:31.220 --> 37:32.480
Can you use your brain?

37:32.610 --> 37:33.860
Can the money from running scams

37:33.860 --> 37:35.610
really compare to the profits from opium?

37:35.610 --> 37:37.130
Isn't the Sect Master's real concern

37:37.130 --> 37:38.860
that once his men
get involved with opium,

37:38.860 --> 37:40.990
they'll grow too powerful to control?

37:41.170 --> 37:41.780
Madam,

37:41.970 --> 37:43.450
I met Chengming today

37:43.780 --> 37:45.740
just to feel him out.

37:45.780 --> 37:47.940
He really has nothing to do
with the Tianxiang Sect.

37:47.940 --> 37:49.130
He came to us

37:49.130 --> 37:51.380
with 10 gold bars in hand.

37:51.860 --> 37:53.520
If we can really work together

37:53.530 --> 37:55.300
and sell the Bashen Powder in Nanyang,

37:55.300 --> 37:56.570
no one will be able to stop us.

37:56.570 --> 37:58.300
And I think Chengming

37:58.650 --> 38:00.650
has powerful connections in
both the underworld and the government.

38:00.650 --> 38:01.450
You think?

38:08.010 --> 38:09.170
He has connections

38:10.130 --> 38:10.930
on both sides?

38:15.130 --> 38:16.390
How about this, Honey?

38:16.420 --> 38:17.420
I'll ask him to come see you

38:17.420 --> 38:18.880
in the next couple of days.

38:18.940 --> 38:20.470
You should size him up, too.

38:27.450 --> 38:28.220
Wait.

38:29.700 --> 38:30.780
You forgot again.

38:33.970 --> 38:35.010
Incense ash in the same cup;

38:35.010 --> 38:36.170
fate on the same slip.

38:36.170 --> 38:37.900
Is that what you said before?

38:38.490 --> 38:39.620
Say the whole thing.

38:49.860 --> 38:50.990
Don't worry, Honey.

38:51.050 --> 38:51.940
Incense ash in the same cup;

38:51.940 --> 38:53.140
fate on the same slip.

38:54.820 --> 38:55.610
You'll sleep

38:56.050 --> 38:57.530
in the shrine tonight.

38:57.970 --> 38:59.220
Repent to the Buddha.

38:59.380 --> 39:00.860
Let him see

39:01.530 --> 39:03.260
whether you're truly sincere.

39:21.220 --> 39:23.340
Seriously, what's your plan now?

39:23.490 --> 39:24.900
She wants someone with military power.

39:24.900 --> 39:25.490
Where am I

39:25.490 --> 39:27.230
supposed to find someone like that?

39:27.230 --> 39:29.830
"Master Chang" can't keep this up
much longer.

39:31.440 --> 39:32.860
You really are something, aren't you?

39:32.860 --> 39:35.260
Too much mutton
will give you too much heat.

39:36.220 --> 39:37.740
Just tell me straight.

39:37.940 --> 39:39.700
What are you really doing
at the Qian family?

39:39.700 --> 39:40.900
To pick something up.

39:41.490 --> 39:42.420
What?

39:43.450 --> 39:44.110
The ledger.

39:45.420 --> 39:47.950
Are you really going
to do business with them?

39:49.820 --> 39:51.080
Keep it under control,

39:51.300 --> 39:52.260
Master Chang.

39:56.330 --> 39:56.930
Take care.

40:25.820 --> 40:26.680
Second Master,

40:26.970 --> 40:28.430
someone is here to see you.

40:29.220 --> 40:30.950
A monk going to a Taoist priest?

40:31.420 --> 40:33.020
Something's definitely up.

40:48.050 --> 40:49.860
I want to make a deal with you.

40:50.220 --> 40:52.220
There's no need for this between us.

40:53.260 --> 40:56.530
I know what you need most right now
is money to pay your troops.

40:56.530 --> 40:57.820
I can help you get it.

41:00.780 --> 41:01.490
Please sit.

41:04.820 --> 41:06.950
I'm going to the Qian family tomorrow.

41:06.970 --> 41:08.260
This time, I'll be going

41:08.260 --> 41:09.130
by Jiang Shuyi.

41:09.220 --> 41:10.750
You're going there for him?

41:12.170 --> 41:13.130
Of course not.

41:13.570 --> 41:14.420
From now on,

41:14.970 --> 41:16.830
if you need anything in Qianshan,

41:18.090 --> 41:19.300
come to me.

41:24.260 --> 41:25.660
I just don't understand.

41:25.860 --> 41:27.790
If you help me get the military pay,

41:29.300 --> 41:30.490
what can I give you?

41:32.970 --> 41:34.300
Getting Commander Feng

41:34.420 --> 41:36.420
to owe me such a big favor is one thing.

41:36.420 --> 41:38.020
I'll have to think carefully

41:38.260 --> 41:40.190
about how to collect on it someday.

41:46.010 --> 41:46.340
Come.

41:46.420 --> 41:47.010
Chengming.

41:47.010 --> 41:47.740
Come on.

41:47.900 --> 41:48.970
Have a drink.

41:49.420 --> 41:51.080
I just like drinking with you.

41:54.780 --> 41:55.260
Bro.

41:55.900 --> 41:58.100
Didn't we agree to meet your wife today?

41:58.340 --> 41:59.390
If we keep drinking like this,

41:59.390 --> 42:00.530
we might not be in any shape to meet her.

42:00.530 --> 42:01.420
Chengming,

42:01.610 --> 42:03.270
there's a saying around here:

42:03.780 --> 42:07.490
It's more important to judge the person
than the money or the goods.

42:07.490 --> 42:08.740
You're a straightforward man.

42:08.740 --> 42:09.530
My wife asked me

42:09.530 --> 42:10.740
to take good care of you.

42:10.740 --> 42:12.470
She will come to meet you later.

42:13.380 --> 42:13.820
Here.

42:13.820 --> 42:14.900
Eat some food.

42:15.930 --> 42:16.420
Try this.

42:16.420 --> 42:17.020
Thank you.

42:22.010 --> 42:22.860
Chengming,

42:24.130 --> 42:25.050
listening to your accent,

42:25.050 --> 42:26.570
you're not actually
from Nanyang, are you?

42:26.570 --> 42:27.740
I was born in Jianghuai

42:27.740 --> 42:29.670
and went to Nanyang a few years ago.

42:30.260 --> 42:30.780
Well,

42:31.530 --> 42:33.340
it seems we are about the same age.

42:33.340 --> 42:34.670
What year were you born?

42:40.570 --> 42:41.090
Honey.

42:46.340 --> 42:47.140
Master Chang,

42:47.380 --> 42:49.380
this is a friend's
Four Pillars of Destiny.

42:49.380 --> 42:50.610
Please read it for me.

42:59.740 --> 43:00.530
Chengming.

43:01.860 --> 43:02.900
Mr. Chengming,

43:03.010 --> 43:04.650
I'm sorry for keeping you waiting.

43:04.650 --> 43:05.650
Third Madam Qian,

43:05.780 --> 43:06.650
I've heard a great deal about you.

43:06.650 --> 43:07.450
It's an honor

43:07.530 --> 43:08.530
to meet you today.

43:09.130 --> 43:11.130
We drank a bit too much last night.

43:11.260 --> 43:12.300
Please don't take it to heart.

43:12.300 --> 43:13.420
It's a small matter.

43:13.420 --> 43:14.620
Don't worry about it.

43:15.010 --> 43:16.420
Please sit down, and let's talk.

43:16.420 --> 43:17.340
Sit.

43:17.420 --> 43:18.220
Master Chang.

43:19.490 --> 43:21.290
Wenxin, pour tea for the guests.

43:25.340 --> 43:26.600
Who is this gentleman?

43:27.130 --> 43:28.590
I forgot to introduce you.

43:28.740 --> 43:30.700
This is Master Chang Youliang,

43:30.700 --> 43:32.220
the 13th-generation real person

43:32.220 --> 43:34.150
of Zijin Temple on Heyun Mountain.

43:34.570 --> 43:35.780
I heard of Master Chang of Zijin Temple

43:35.780 --> 43:37.980
on Heyun Mountain when I was in Nanyang.

43:38.380 --> 43:39.340
It's truly an honor

43:39.340 --> 43:40.340
to meet you today.

43:40.450 --> 43:41.260
If there's a chance,

43:41.260 --> 43:43.260
I hope you can give me some guidance.

43:43.260 --> 43:44.130
You flatter me.

43:44.420 --> 43:45.820
I won't hide it from you, sir.

43:45.820 --> 43:48.170
We've had some trouble at home recently.

43:48.860 --> 43:50.780
So I specially invited the Master
down the mountain

43:50.780 --> 43:51.910
to take a look for us.

43:52.490 --> 43:53.820
May I ask what happened?

43:54.170 --> 43:56.030
Is there anything I can help with?

43:56.700 --> 43:58.560
Actually, it was a few days ago...

44:00.650 --> 44:03.260
This is the finest Pu'er tea
we've had this year.

44:03.260 --> 44:04.060
Please try it.

44:04.260 --> 44:04.740
Okay.

44:04.900 --> 44:05.450
Master,

44:05.570 --> 44:06.300
please try it, too.

44:06.300 --> 44:06.780
Okay.

44:13.740 --> 44:14.900
Wenxin told me

44:15.220 --> 44:16.450
you had some ideas...

44:18.340 --> 44:20.610
about our family business.

44:21.220 --> 44:23.280
Why don't you tell me more about them?

44:24.860 --> 44:26.940
Since you've gotten straight to the point,

44:26.940 --> 44:28.940
I'll get straight to the point, too.

44:29.450 --> 44:31.510
I run a shipping business in Nanyang,

44:31.650 --> 44:33.380
and I have two shipping routes.

44:33.700 --> 44:34.740
My cargo ships

44:34.860 --> 44:35.650
make at least

44:35.740 --> 44:36.870
9 round trips a week.

44:37.130 --> 44:38.780
I'll handle the shipping both ways.

44:38.780 --> 44:39.740
We'll split the profits

44:39.740 --> 44:41.820
70-30.

44:42.220 --> 44:43.220
What do you think,

44:43.420 --> 44:44.300
Third Madam?

44:46.900 --> 44:48.380
You call the shots at sea.

44:50.340 --> 44:51.380
But...

44:51.700 --> 44:53.360
we're nowhere near the coast.

44:53.450 --> 44:55.300
Getting goods from the mountains
to the docks

44:55.300 --> 44:56.970
is a real ordeal.

44:58.450 --> 45:00.220
I don't know if you

45:00.380 --> 45:01.740
has what it takes.

45:02.610 --> 45:03.810
Cats have their ways,

45:04.050 --> 45:05.250
and dogs have theirs.

45:05.260 --> 45:06.740
Since I came all the way here

45:06.740 --> 45:08.090
to do business with you,

45:08.300 --> 45:09.570
whatever you're worried about

45:09.570 --> 45:10.380
is not

45:10.900 --> 45:12.010
a problem for me.

45:12.780 --> 45:13.780
I'm all ears.

45:14.780 --> 45:16.170
It's so lively today.

45:18.380 --> 45:19.710
Second Brother is back.

45:20.260 --> 45:21.390
We have guests here.

45:22.220 --> 45:23.420
Let me introduce you.

45:24.090 --> 45:25.970
This is Master Chang Youliang

45:26.170 --> 45:27.780
from Zijin Temple on Heyun Mountain.

45:27.780 --> 45:28.980
He's from Nanyang...

45:29.130 --> 45:30.420
My sister's believed in this sort of thing

45:30.420 --> 45:32.010
since she was a child.

45:32.410 --> 45:34.610
She considers herself
a spiritual practitioner.

45:34.610 --> 45:35.700
I think

45:36.090 --> 45:38.550
she'll end up becoming
a nun sooner or later.

45:38.970 --> 45:40.050
Life itself

45:40.570 --> 45:42.010
is a cultivation.

45:43.380 --> 45:44.900
Well said, Master.

45:45.450 --> 45:46.820
There's something

45:46.970 --> 45:48.530
I'd like you to read for me.

45:49.570 --> 45:50.650
Can you read

45:51.010 --> 45:52.140
between the two of us

45:53.780 --> 45:54.840
who calls the shots

45:55.300 --> 45:56.220
in this family?

45:56.700 --> 45:57.630
Second Brother.

45:58.490 --> 46:00.260
Since Third Madam has
family matters to deal with,

46:00.260 --> 46:01.790
I'll come back another day.

46:01.900 --> 46:03.360
Don't make it another day.

46:03.500 --> 46:05.430
Since the Master won't read for me,

46:05.970 --> 46:06.570
then

46:07.380 --> 46:08.780
I'll read yours instead.

46:11.780 --> 46:13.130
Young man,

46:13.820 --> 46:15.420
you have a compound surname,

46:15.740 --> 46:16.450
Shangguan.

46:17.490 --> 46:19.150
You're Shangguan Chengming,

46:19.650 --> 46:20.260
right?

46:21.650 --> 46:22.220
Master,

46:22.610 --> 46:24.010
was my reading accurate?

46:26.490 --> 46:27.420
Do you know

46:27.720 --> 46:29.110
how I read it out?

46:34.780 --> 46:35.650
Come in.

46:52.300 --> 46:53.610
You didn't expect this, did you?

46:53.610 --> 46:54.730
I'm still alive.

46:58.780 --> 47:01.030
[In the next episode]

47:01.170 --> 47:02.130
Miss Shuyi.

47:02.700 --> 47:03.570
Come in.

47:03.710 --> 47:04.910
Sect Master asked you

47:05.860 --> 47:06.990
when you would do it.

47:10.650 --> 47:11.440
Today.

47:17.000 --> 47:18.060
Second Madam Qian.

47:19.010 --> 47:21.010
You didn't invite me to the wedding?

47:21.940 --> 47:23.460
Let me introduce her.

47:24.160 --> 47:24.950
This is

47:25.050 --> 47:26.650
the woman I'm about to marry,

47:27.010 --> 47:27.780
Jiang Shuyi.

47:27.810 --> 47:30.170
I've only just met Mr. Chengming.

47:30.730 --> 47:31.980
Why would I have invited you?

47:31.980 --> 47:34.750
Whether you invited me or not,
I'm here now.

47:35.420 --> 47:37.420
I just wonder whether this marriage

47:37.420 --> 47:38.940
is real or not.
